(
  'The Trust Economy: How Verification is Becoming the New Currency',
  'trust-economy-verification-new-currency-2025',
  E'## What is the Trust Economy?\n\nIn a world drowning in misinformation, **trust has become the most valuable commodity**. The Trust Economy is an emerging paradigm where individuals and organizations earn real value by verifying claims, fact-checking content, and building transparent reputations.\n\nAt TrustLighthouse, we''re pioneering this shift — turning everyday people into verifiers who earn rewards, mint NFT badges, and build credibility scores that matter.\n\n### Why Trust Matters More Than Ever\n\nAccording to the Edelman Trust Barometer, trust in media and institutions is at historic lows. This creates a massive opportunity:\n\n- **Misinformation costs the global economy over $78 billion annually**\n- **83% of consumers** say they need to trust a brand before buying\n- **News organizations** are struggling to keep up with the volume of false claims\n\n### How TrustLighthouse Powers the Trust Economy\n\nOur platform creates a **decentralized verification ecosystem** where:\n\n1. **Anyone can verify claims** — Submit content for AI-powered analysis backed by real sources\n2. **Earn rewards for accuracy** — Build your trust score and earn through bounties\n3. **Mint proof of work** — Every verification can become an NFT badge proving your contribution\n4. **Organizations pay for truth** — Companies and NGOs post bounties for verified information\n\n### The Verification Flywheel\n\nThe more you verify, the more you earn. The more you earn, the higher your trust score. The higher your trust score, the more valuable your verifications become. This creates a self-reinforcing cycle that rewards honesty and accuracy.\n\n> "In the Trust Economy, your reputation isn''t just social capital — it''s real, transferable value."\n\n### Getting Started\n\nWhether you''re a journalist, researcher, student, or curious citizen, you can start earning in the Trust Economy today:\n\n1. **Sign up** on TrustLighthouse\n2. **Verify your first claim** using our AI-powered tools\n3. **Claim bounties** posted by organizations\n4. **Mint your Truth Badge NFT** as proof of your work\n5. **Rise on the leaderboard** and unlock achievements\n\nThe future belongs to those who can be trusted. Start building your trust capital today.',
  'Discover how the Trust Economy is transforming verification into real earning potential. Learn how verifiers earn rewards, mint NFT badges, and build valuable reputations.',
  'fact-checking',
