(
  'NFT Truth Badges: Why Your Verification Work Deserves Blockchain Proof',
  'nft-truth-badges-verification-blockchain-proof',
  E'## Your Verifications Deserve More Than a Thank You\n\nEvery time you fact-check a claim, debunk misinformation, or verify a source, you''re doing work that matters. But until now, that work disappeared into the void.\n\n**NFT Truth Badges change that.**\n\n### What Are Truth Badges?\n\nTruth Badges are blockchain-verified NFTs that permanently record your verification work. Think of them as digital credentials that prove you contributed to the fight against misinformation.\n\nEach badge contains:\n- ✅ The claim you verified\n- 📊 Your confidence score\n- 🕐 Timestamp of verification\n- 🏅 Rarity tier based on complexity\n\n### The Five Rarity Tiers\n\n| Tier | How to Earn | Perks |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Common** | Complete any verification | Entry-level badge |\n| **Uncommon** | Verify with 80%+ accuracy | Boosted trust score |\n| **Rare** | Complete bounty verifications | Marketplace tradeable |\n| **Epic** | Maintain 30-day streaks | Premium bounty access |\n| **Legendary** | Top leaderboard placement | Organization partnerships |\n\n### Why Blockchain Matters for Verification\n\nTraditional fact-checking has a credibility problem — who checks the checkers? Blockchain solves this by:\n\n1. **Immutable records** — Your work can''t be altered or deleted\n2. **Transparent history** — Anyone can verify your track record\n3. **Portable reputation** — Your badges work across platforms\n4. **Real ownership** — You truly own your verification history\n\n### Badge Evolution\n\nYour badges aren''t static. As you continue verifying, your badges **evolve**:\n\n- Level 1: Base badge with your verification\n- Level 2: Enhanced visual after 10 related verifications\n- Level 3: Animated badge after 25 verifications\n- Level 4: Legendary status with special traits\n\n### Trading on OpenSea\n\nTruth Badges are fully compatible with OpenSea and other NFT marketplaces. Rare and legendary badges from significant fact-checks can become valuable collectors'' items.\n\n### The Bigger Picture\n\nNFT Truth Badges aren''t just about earning — they''re about building a **permanent record of truth**. Every badge minted is another brick in the wall against misinformation.\n\nWhen future generations look back at this era, they''ll see a blockchain full of verified truths, each one backed by a real person who cared enough to check.\n\n**Start minting your legacy today.**',
